flowchart TD
    LogoutStart([POST /api/v1/auth/logout]) --> AuthCheck{Authenticated?}
    
    AuthCheck -->|No| Logout401[❌ 401 Unauthorized<br/>Code: AUTH_TOKEN_MISSING<br/>Already logged out or no token]
    
    AuthCheck -->|Yes| ExtractToken[Extract Refresh Token<br/>From request body or cookie]
    
    ExtractToken --> TokenProvided{Token<br/>Provided?}
    
    TokenProvided -->|No| LogoutAllDevices{Logout from<br/>all devices?}
    
    LogoutAllDevices -->|Yes| BeginTxAll[🚀 BEGIN Transaction]
    
    BeginTxAll --> RevokeAll[🔒 Revoke All User Tokens<br/>UPDATE auth_tokens<br/>SET revoked_at = NOW,<br/>revoked_reason = LOGOUT_ALL<br/>WHERE user_id = $1<br/>AND revoked_at IS NULL]
    
    RevokeAll --> RevokeAllOK{Revoke All<br/>Success?}
    
    RevokeAllOK -->|Failed| RollbackAll[⏮️ ROLLBACK]
    RollbackAll --> Logout500All[❌ 500 Internal Server Error<br/>Code: LOGOUT_FAILED]
    
    RevokeAllOK -->|Success| AuditAll[📋 Audit Log<br/>action: USER_LOGOUT_ALL_DEVICES<br/>tokens_revoked_count]
    
    AuditAll --> CommitAll[✅ COMMIT Transaction]
    
    CommitAll --> Logout200All[✅ 200 OK<br/>Code: SUCCESS<br/>Message: Logged out from all devices<br/>Data: devicesLoggedOut: count]
    
    LogoutAllDevices -->|No - Current only| TokenProvided
    
    TokenProvided -->|Yes| HashToken[🔐 Hash Token<br/>SHA-256]
    
    HashToken --> BeginTx[🚀 BEGIN Transaction]
    
    BeginTx --> FindToken[🔍 Find Token<br/>SELECT token_id<br/>FROM auth_tokens<br/>WHERE token_hash = $1<br/>AND user_id = $2<br/>AND revoked_at IS NULL]
    
    FindToken --> TokenExists{Token<br/>Found?}
    
    TokenExists -->|No| RollbackNotFound[⏮️ ROLLBACK]
    RollbackNotFound --> Logout404[❌ 404 Not Found<br/>Code: TOKEN_NOT_FOUND<br/>Token already revoked or invalid]
    
    TokenExists -->|Yes| RevokeCurrent[🔒 Revoke Token<br/>UPDATE auth_tokens<br/>SET revoked_at = NOW,<br/>revoked_reason = USER_LOGOUT<br/>WHERE token_id = $1]
    
    RevokeCurrent --> RevokeOK{Revoke<br/>Success?}
    
    RevokeOK -->|Failed| RollbackRevoke[⏮️ ROLLBACK]
    RollbackRevoke --> Logout500[❌ 500 Internal Server Error<br/>Code: LOGOUT_FAILED]
    
    RevokeOK -->|Success| AuditLogout[📋 Audit Log<br/>action: USER_LOGOUT<br/>entity: auth_token<br/>token_id]
    
    AuditLogout --> CommitLogout[✅ COMMIT Transaction]
    
    CommitLogout --> CommitOK{Commit<br/>OK?}
    
    CommitOK -->|Failed| Logout500Commit[❌ 500 Internal Server Error<br/>Code: DB_COMMIT_FAILED]
    
    CommitOK -->|Success| ClearCookie[🍪 Clear Cookie<br/>Set-Cookie: token=; Max-Age=0<br/>Clear session cookies]
    
    ClearCookie --> Logout200[✅ 200 OK<br/>Code: SUCCESS<br/>Message: Logged out successfully]
    
    Logout401 --> LogoutEnd
    Logout404 --> LogoutEnd
    Logout500 --> LogoutEnd
    Logout500All --> LogoutEnd
    Logout500Commit --> LogoutEnd
    Logout200 --> LogoutEnd
    Logout200All --> LogoutEnd([Logout Complete])
    
